# Values for integrations/portrait-spec/lead.md in this package (sync.sh).
# A Cursor plugin, listed by the root .cursor-plugin/marketplace.json. Cursor
# gives a plugin no variable for its own folder, so each command says how to
# find it. Cursor's headless agent has no read-only setting, so the
# portrait's own model runs use another CLI (RUNNER=auto).
LEAD=Cursor
LEAD_ID=cursor
RUNNER=auto
SCRIPT="<plugin-root>/scripts/portrait-agents"
PORTRAIT_COMMAND=/portrait:build
AS_ME_COMMAND=/portrait:do
FIDELITY_COMMAND=/portrait:fidelity
PUBLISH_COMMAND=/portrait:publish
JOBS_COMMAND=/portrait:jobs
COMMANDS_DIR=integrations/cursor-plugin/commands
COMMANDS_FORMAT=md
COMMANDS_NOTE=Here `<plugin-root>` is this plugin's folder, the one holding `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json` and `scripts/portrait-agents`. Find it once with `find ~/.cursor/plugins -type f -path '*portrait*/scripts/portrait-agents'` and use its absolute path in every command.
